        "Jaroslav Weigel\nJaroslav Weigel( 2 January 1931 Rychnov nad Kněžnou – 5 September 2019) was a Czech actor, writer, playwright, comics writer and painter. From 1970, he was a member of the\" Jára Cimrman Theatre\"."
