      "gold_doc_ids": [
        "R. D. Call\nR. D. Call( born February 16, 1950) is an American film and television actor. He has appeared in several films including\" 48 Hrs.\"( 1982),\" Brewster's Millions\"( 1985),\" At Close Range\"( 1986),\" No Man's Land\"( 1987),\" Colors\"( 1988),\" Born on the Fourth of July\"( 1989),\" Young Guns II\"( 1990),\" State of Grace\"( 1990),\" Waterworld\"( 1995),\" Murder by Numbers\"( 2002),\" Babel\"( 2006), and\" Into the Wild\"( 2007).",
