        "Behind Locked Doors (1991 film)\nBehind Locked Doors is a feature film by Swiss/ German director Anka Schmid from 1991. The ensemble- film shows the everyday life of 17 inhabitants of an apartment building in Berlin Kreuzberg.",
        "Invasion of the Neptune Men\nThe film was released in 1961 in Japan and was later released in the United States on television. In 1998, the film was featured on an episode of\" Mystery Science Theater 3000\".",
        "Any Body...Any Way\nAny Body…Any Way, (re-released under the name Behind Locked Doors) is a 1968 Sexploitation Roughie film directed by Charles Romine and starring Eve Reeves, Joyce Denner, and Daniel Garth.",
        "Rakka (film)\nThe film was released on YouTube and Steam on 14 June 2017.",
        "Coney Island Baby (film)\nConey Island Baby is a 2003 comedy- drama in which film producer Amy Hobby made her directorial debut. Karl Geary wrote the film and Tanya Ryno was the film's producer. The music was composed by Ryan Shore. The film was shot in Sligo, Ireland, which is known locally as\" Coney Island\". The film was screened at the Newport International Film Festival. Hobby won the Jury Award for\" Best First Time Director\". The film made its premiere television broadcast on the Sundance Channel.",
