        "Two for Texas\nTwo for Texas is a 1998 American Western film directed by Rod Hardy, written by Larry Brothers, and starring Kris Kristofferson, Scott Bairstow, Irene Bedard, Tom Skerritt, Peter Coyote and Victor Rivers. It is based on the 1982 novel \"Two for Texas\" by James Lee Burke. The film premiered on TNT on January 18, 1998.",
