        "Juan Carlos Pérez Frías\nJuan Carlos Pérez Frías( born 27 July 1956), known as Juan Carlos, is a Spanish former professional footballer who played as a midfielder.",
        "Alberto Falcón\nAlberto Falcón( born 3 May 1970) is a Spanish fencer. He competed in the sabre events at the 1992 and 2000 Summer Olympics."
      ]
