        "Inside Man: Most Wanted\nInside Man: Most Wanted is an American crime thriller film directed by M. J. Bassett and starring Aml Ameen, Rhea Seehorn, and Roxanne McKee. A sequel to 2006 film\" Inside Man\", it was released direct- to- video in the United States on September 24, 2019. It was released for streaming through Netflix, and other pay on demand digital avenues, on September 24, 2019.",
