        "Louis Ncamiso Ndlovu\nLouis Ncamiso Ndlovu( March 15, 1945 – August 27, 2012) was the Roman Catholic bishop of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Manzini, Swaziland. Ordained to the priesthood in 1975, Ndlovu was named a bishop in 1985; he died in office.",
        "Fred H. Frank\nFred H. Frank was a member of the Wisconsin State Assembly who lived in Appleton."
      ]
